T*
(   Right\).) Tj
T*
(   - Once placed, clicking the Section Plane displays four operational states:) Tj
T*
(   * Plane: Displays a transparent cutting plane with viewing arrow.) Tj
T*
(   * Slice: Displays a thin slab cut.) Tj
T*
(   * Boundary: Restricts cut to a bounded rectangular box.) Tj
T*
