(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the 3DORBIT command in AutoCAD, contrasting Constrained Orbit, Free Orbit, and Continuous Orbit, explaining navigation controls and camera manipulation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. 3DORBIT Command Architecture \(3DO\):) Tj
T*
(   - The primary interactive viewport navigation command in AutoCAD for 3D modeling, allowing) Tj
T*
(   dynamic inspection of spatial geometry from any arbitrary vantage point.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Detailed Comparison of Orbit Modes:) Tj
T*
(   - Constrained Orbit \(3DORBIT\):) Tj
T*
(   * Restricts camera rotation strictly about the global or local vertical Z-axis \(turntable) Tj
T*
(   camera model\).) Tj
T*
(   * Prevents the model from pitching or tumbling uncontrollably upside-down, maintaining) Tj
T*
(   intuitive horizontal horizon orientation.) Tj
T*
(   * Best for architectural walkarounds and standard mechanical assembly inspection.) Tj
T*
(   - Free Orbit \(3DFORBIT\):) Tj
T*
(   * Displays a green on-screen navigation circle \(Arcball\) with four quadrant cursor handles.) Tj
T*
(   * Allows complete 3-degree-of-freedom spherical rotation:) Tj
T*
(   - Inside circle: Unrestricted roll, pitch, and yaw.) Tj
T*
(   - Outside circle: Rolls camera strictly about view line of sight.) Tj
T*
(   - Left/Right handles: Horizontal tumbling.) Tj
T*
(   - Top/Bottom handles: Vertical tumbling.) Tj
T*
(   - Continuous Orbit \(3DCORBIT\):) Tj
T*
(   * Clicking and dragging the cursor imparts angular momentum; when the mouse button is released,) Tj
T*
(   the 3D model continues to rotate smoothly and autonomously at the imparted speed.) Tj
T*
(   * Ideal for design reviews, engineering presentations, and animated video capture.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Fast Heads-Up Shortcut:) Tj
T*
(   - Holding down SHIFT + Pressing Mouse Scroll Wheel activates real-time 3D orbit from within any) Tj
T*
(   active command instantly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
