(   [Problem Statement]: A right regular square pyramid of base side 40 mm and altitude 60 mm is cut by an inclined cutting plane at 45 degrees passing through a point on the axis 20 mm above the base. Detail the complete procedure to develop the lateral surface of the lower frustum.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Geometric Coordinates and True Slant Edge:) Tj
T*
(   - Base side s = 40 mm, Height H = 60 mm.) Tj
T*
(   - Corner distance in plan: r = 40 / sqrt\(2\) = 28.28 mm.) Tj
T*
(   - True Slant Length of Corner Edge:) Tj
T*
(   L = sqrt\( 60^2 + 28.28^2 \) = sqrt\( 3600 + 800 \) = sqrt\( 4400 \) = 66.33 mm.) Tj
T*
(   - Cutting Plane: Inclined at 45? to horizontal, cutting axis at height z = 20 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Determining True Lengths of Cut Points:) Tj
T*
(   - Draw front view with true slant edge o'1' on the right.) Tj
T*
(   - The 45? plane cuts corner edges at points a', b', c', d'.) Tj
T*
(   - Project cut points a', b', c', d' HORIZONTALLY onto the outer true-length slant edge o'1'.) Tj
T*
(   - Measure the true distances from apex o' along the outer edge to each projected cut point:) Tj
T*
(   * Let these true distances be La, Lb, Lc, Ld.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Radial Development Layout:) Tj
T*
(   - Step 1: With center O and radius L = 66.33 mm, swing a large circular arc.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 2: Draw initial ray O-1. Step off four 40 mm chords along the arc: points 1, 2, 3, 4,) Tj
T*
(   1'.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 3: Draw radial fold lines O-2, O-3, O-4, and closing line O-1'. Connect base points) Tj
T*
(   1-2-3-4-1' with straight lines.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 4 \(Transferring Cut Points\):) Tj
T*
(   * Along radial lines O-1 and O-1', measure true distance La from apex O to mark point A.) Tj
T*
(   * Along radial line O-2, measure true distance Lb from apex O to mark point B.) Tj
T*
(   * Along radial line O-3, measure true distance Lc from apex O to mark point C.) Tj
T*
(   * Along radial line O-4, measure true distance Ld from apex O to mark point D.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 5: Connect cut points A - B - C - D - A with STRAIGHT LINES! \(Crucial: Cut lines on flat) Tj
T*
