(   [Problem Statement]: A cylindrical boiler chimney of diameter 800 mm penetrates through an inclined corrugated roof sloped at 30 degrees to the horizontal. Explain the step-by-step procedure to develop the hole opening cut into the flat roof plate.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Geometry:) Tj
T*
(   - When a vertical right circular cylinder penetrates through a flat planar roof inclined at) Tj
T*
(   angle theta = 30 degrees to the horizontal:) Tj
T*
(   - The intersection curve on the inclined roof plate is a TRUE MATHEMATICAL ELLIPSE!) Tj
T*
(   - Ellipse Dimensions:) Tj
T*
(   * Minor Axis \(2b\): Measured perpendicular to the slope. It equals the TRUE DIAMETER of the) Tj
T*
(   chimney: 2b = D = 800 mm.) Tj
T*
(   * Major Axis \(2a\): Measured along the 30-degree slope of the roof. It is elongated by the) Tj
T*
(   inclination:) Tj
T*
(   2a = D / cos\(theta\) = 800 / cos\(30?\) = 800 / 0.8660 = 923.76 mm!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Step-by-Step Drafting Procedure on the Flat Roof Sheet:) Tj
T*
(   - Step 1: Draw the longitudinal centerline of the roof plate \(along the slope direction\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 2: Draw the transverse centerline perpendicular to the longitudinal axis. The) Tj
T*
(   intersection is center point C.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 3: Along the longitudinal centerline, lay off the semi-major axis distance: a = 923.76 /) Tj
T*
(   2 = 461.88 mm on either side of center C \(points A and B\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 4: Along the transverse centerline, lay off the semi-minor axis distance: b = 800 / 2 =) Tj
T*
(   400.00 mm on either side of center C \(points D and E\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 5 \(AutoCAD Drafting\):) Tj
T*
(   * Command: ELLIPSE [Enter] -> Type 'C' \(Center\) [Enter].) Tj
T*
(   * Specify center: Click C.) Tj
T*
(   * Specify endpoint of major axis: Snap to A \(distance 461.88 mm\).) Tj
T*
(   * Specify distance to minor axis: Snap to D \(distance 400.00 mm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 6: AutoCAD generates the mathematically perfect elliptical cutout hole of 923.76 mm x) Tj
T*
(   800.00 mm!) Tj
T*
(   - When the roof plate is installed at its 30-degree slope, this elliptical hole accommodates) Tj
T*
(   the 800 mm vertical chimney with zero clearance binding.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
